   "text": "Griffith College (Foundation) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nGriffith College (Foundation)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nGriffith College is an on-campus study option to achieve academic credit into hundreds of Griffith University degree majors, including 8-12 month Diploma’s which will transition students straight into their 2nd year of a range of University Bachelor degrees.\nLocated within the Griffith University Southport (Gold Coast) and Mt Gravatt (Brisbane) Campuses, the College is embedded within the Griffith University community and offers students a great opportunity for entry to higher degree programs, with extra support and services available for each student to succeed.\nGriffith University is ranked in the top 2% of universities globally, enjoys research excellence, innovative teaching and learning practices, along with strong ties to industry. \nCRICOS Provider Code: 01737F.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:01\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:21\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$20,899.00\nMin: A$20,899.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n20%\n9,200 of 46,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1971\nCampus(es)\nBrisbane, Gold Coast, Nathan\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qq3n60AKXuI\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
